# Who reviews changes to this repo. GitHub requests a review from the matching owners on every pull request, and,
# with branch protection's "Require review from Code Owners" on, an owner must approve before merging.
# The last matching line wins. This file covers this repo only: GitHub never inherits CODEOWNERS (or LICENSE) from
# another repo, so every repo has its own. The community files and templates here are inherited, as defaults for repos
# without their own, so changes to them are reviewed by the people who run how we work.
#
# Teams are managed in the organization's settings, under Teams. A team listed here must have write access to
# this repo, or GitHub ignores the line.

# Everything
*                                   @sensenetInc/platform

# How we work, and the policies every repo inherits
/CONTRIBUTING.md                    @sensenetInc/platform
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md                 @sensenetInc/platform
/SUPPORT.md                         @sensenetInc/platform
/SECURITY.md                        @sensenetInc/security @sensenetInc/platform
/LICENSE                            @sensenetInc/platform

# Templates every repo uses
/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/            @sensenetInc/platform
/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/security.md @sensenetInc/platform @sensenetInc/security
/.github/pull_request_template.md   @sensenetInc/platform
/.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE/     @sensenetInc/platform

# The organization's public profile
/profile/                           @sensenetInc/platform

# This file
/.github/CODEOWNERS                 @sensenetInc/platform
